window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>To save her people, Aisling must question everything—even herself.</b><br> <br> Blinded by betrayal, Aisling's heart burns for revenge against Kohen, the man she once trusted. But war looms on two fronts—Luska and Imbria—and her people are caught in the crossfire. As battle lines are drawn and alliances tested, Aisling faces an impossible choice: to side with the lesser evil or risk everything for her people’s survival.<br> <br> Amid the chaos, truths begin to unravel. With every step closer to victory, Aisling is haunted by one question: Could Kohen have been right all along?<br> <br> The final book in the pulse pounding trilogy!</p>"; 
